  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      178.77,
      230.69,
      384.93,
      255.47
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE FISHERIES AND AQUATIC RESOURCESACT, NO. 2 OF 1996",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      270.89,
      401.9,
      295.67
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      311.09,
      401.73,
      335.87
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Fisheries and AquaticResources (Amendment) Act, No. of 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      351.29,
      401.87,
      416.27
    ],
    "text": "2.The following new section is hereby insertedimmediately after section 28 of the Fisheries and AquaticResources Act, No. 2 of 1996 (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and shall have effect as section28A of that enactment:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      431.69,
      401.92,
      509.99
    ],
    "text": "28A. (1) (a) No person shall engage in orcause any other person to be engaged in fishingoperations utilizing Trawl Nets, including netswithout two wings or using vertical poles atthe two free ends of the net, to be towed bymotorized or mechanized fishing boats.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      525.53,
      401.87,
      590.39
    ],
    "text": "(b) No person shall use, possess, import,transport, purchase or sell any Trawl Net, to betowed by a motorized or mechanized fishingboat for the purpose of carrying out fishingoperations in Sri Lanka Waters.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      605.93,
      401.89,
      670.79
    ],
    "text": "(2) No license shall be issued by theDirector-General under Part II of this Act forfishing operations carried out by Trawl Nets tobe towed by a motorized or mechanized fishingboat in Sri Lanka Waters.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      313.03,
      444.58,
      322.1
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      352.03,
      449.13,
      395.9
    ],
    "text": "Insertion ofnew section28A in theprincipalenactment.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      432.67,
      205.3,
      480.14
    ],
    "text": "\u201cProhibitionof fishingoperationsutilizingTrawl Nets.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
