  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      203.45,
      397.2,
      265.55
    ],
    "text": "(3) Any license, issued under this Act forfishing operations carried out utilizing TrawlNets towed by motorized or mechanizedfishing boats in Sri Lanka Waters, shall not berenewed:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      279.65,
      397.23,
      379.79
    ],
    "text": "Provided that, a license already issued for theuse of Trawl Nets and which is still in force onthe day preceding the date of commencementof this Act, shall notwithstanding anything tothe contrary in this Act, continue to be validfor the purpose and in respect of which thelicense has been issued, for the period specifiedtherein.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      393.89,
      397.2,
      430.67
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 49 of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the insertion immediately after subsection (2A)thereof, of the following new subsection:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      193.15,
      444.65,
      397.2,
      532.19
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(2AA) Any person who contravenes or fails tocomply with the provisions of section 28A of thisAct shall be guilty of an offence and shall onconviction after summary trial before a Magistrate,be liable to an imprisonment for a term notexceeding two years or to a fine not less than fiftythousand rupees.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      546.29,
      397.18,
      595.67
    ],
    "text": "4.Section 66 of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the insertion, immediately after the definitionof the expression \u201cSri Lanka Waters\u201d, of the following newdefinition:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      193.15,
      609.77,
      397.19,
      671.87
    ],
    "text": "\u201c \u201cTrawl Net\u201d means a towing net having a coneshaped body and a bag or cod end (madiya)connected to the apex with or without twowings connected to the other end and towedby motorized or mechanized fishing boats.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      403.15,
      547.15,
      448.88,
      593.18
    ],
    "text": "Amendmentof section 66of theprincipalenactment.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      403.15,
      395.71,
      448.88,
      441.62
    ],
    "text": "Amendmentof section 49of theprincipalenactment.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
